{"hymn":"S108","parent":"E129","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"De gloria coronado está","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su exaltación","syl":{"n1":"De","n2":["glo","i"],"n3":["ria","t"],"n4":["co","i"],"n5":["ro","m"],"n6":["na","m"],"n7":["do‿es","m"],"n8":["tá","t"],"n9":"El","n10":["Cor","i"],"n11":["de","m"],"n12":["ro","t"],"n13":"de","n14":"Dios:","n15":"Dios","n16":["to","i"],"n17":["do","t"],"n18":"Su","n19":["po","i"],"n20":["der","t"],"n21":"le","n22":"dio,","n23":"Al","n24":["cie","i"],"n25":["lo","t"],"n27":["lo‿e","i"],"n28":["xal","m"],"n29":["tó.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Él llena el trono celestial,","Suyo‿el derecho es;","Del Padre,‿objeto de Su‿amor,","¡Nuestra canción es Él!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Nuestra‿alabanza‿acepta Él","Aunque tan alto‿está;","La voz más débil Él oirá;","Su‿oído inclinará."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Cantamos hoy en unidad","¡El Nombre aclamad","De‿Aquel que en el trono está!","¡Al Cordero‿exaltad!"]},{"label":"5.","lines":["A‿Aquel que despreciado fue,","Dad gloria y honor;","¡Al encumbrado alabad!","¡Corona se le dio!"]}]}